  "releaseNotes": "## v1.11.4 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.11.3:\n\n- Keep a csproj's declaration and line endings in migrate-cpm, and migrate \\<Version\\> child elements [patch] (#393) (matt-edmondson)\n- Skip linked directories when finding files for markdown and merge [patch] (#400) (matt-edmondson)\n- Time a re-run workflow from its latest attempt in build-monitor [patch] (#403) (matt-edmondson)\n- Fall back to the GitHub API when gh is not on PATH in sync --pr [patch] (#404) (matt-edmondson)",
